/S /H5
/P 55 0 R
/T (The Career Development Center congratulates our Emergent Scholars on their success. To continue this progress, we are here to help! The Career Development Center educates students on career readiness skills, facilitates connections with employers for internships and jobs, and supports students on their professional journey. The Career Development Center hosts various events each semester to help students connect with employers and prepare for their professional journey. We encourage students to utilize Handshake to look for internship and job opportunities and register for career development events throughout the year. Students can log on to Handshake to view  upcoming on-campus and virtual career fairs and events! Students can also schedule an appointment with the Career Development Center on Handshake for the following topics: Resume Creation or Review, Cover Letter Creation or Review, Internship or Job Search Help, Job or Internship Application Questions, Career or Major Exploration, Practice Interview, LinkedIn/Handshake Profile Help, Graduate School Discussion and Search, and Graduate School Practice Interview. We look forward to meeting with you soon to help you meet your career aspirations!)
/E (The Career Development Center congratulates our Emergent Scholars on their success. To continue this progress, we are here to help! The Career Development Center educates students on career readiness skills, facilitates connections with employers for internships and jobs, and supports students on their professional journey. The Career Development Center hosts various events each semester to help students connect with employers and prepare for their professional journey. We encourage students to utilize Handshake to look for internship and job opportunities and register for career development events throughout the year. Students can log on to Handshake to view  upcoming on-campus and virtual career fairs and events! Students can also schedule an appointment with the Career Development Center on Handshake for the following topics: Resume Creation or Review, Cover Letter Creation or Review, Internship or Job Search Help, Job or Internship Application Questions, Career or Major Exploration, Practice Interview, LinkedIn/Handshake Profile Help, Graduate School Discussion and Search, and Graduate School Practice Interview. We look forward to meeting with you soon to help you meet your career aspirations!)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
